Port of fixup/10/profile/perf/23_frameless_riscv64 to .NET 11.
.NET 11 differences: CodeGen/LSRA hold the compiler as m_compiler; the
prolog/epilog asserts are the emitter's emitGeneratingProlog/Epilog*;
genRestoreCalleeSavedRegistersHelp takes a base register and a
reportUnwindData flag; RBM_CALL_GC_REGS(_ORDER) no longer exist (the
across-call GC register set is derived from RBM_INT_CALLEE_SAVED).

